INSERT INTO public.user_reflections VALUES ('5f6322c2-f6b5-4be2-be46-a03eefeb25af', '8a15f3b4-35a3-4810-beb5-85c298d0633b', 'c98431e5-81eb-4630-acd2-b06725387c71', 'aaa', 'Ahoy, brave voyager! 🌊 You’ve just set sail amidst the vast ocean of personal growth by sharing a piece of your treasure with someone who values you. This is no small feat; like a skilled navigator charting a new course, you’ve faced the unknown waters of vulnerability and emerged triumphant. Your courage shines brightly, like a lighthouse on a stormy night, guiding your ship to safe harbors. 🐚
INSERT INTO public.user_reflections VALUES ('590c93db-29b8-438c-8fc4-5fe904f24dbb', '8a15f3b4-35a3-4810-beb5-85c298d0633b', 'b0dc53e7-8784-4316-b472-deeb5721f654', 'aaaaa', 'Wow, well done! You''ve taken a courageous leap, like a dolphin springing joyfully from the depths of the ocean to touch the sky. 🌊😊 Your words, much like the gentle caress of a calming sea breeze, may have been the beacon of light someone needed today. It''s perfectly natural to feel a bit crabby 🦀 when stepping out of your comfort zone, but remember, even the smallest starfish 🌟 can leave a lasting impression on the shore. Keep riding the waves 🌊, for each one brings new strength and confidence! ⚓🐚', 'positive', true, '2025-12-11 20:47:19.913931');
INSERT INTO public.user_reflections VALUES ('ec2c05e9-6017-48c1-b347-be526f2110b4', '8a15f3b4-35a3-4810-beb5-85c298d0633b', '805127fd-8a8e-48ef-aed4-69ee4b33280a', 'aaaaaa', 'Ahoy there, brave soul! 🌊 You’ve set sail on the vast ocean of conversation, steering your ship with courage and a steady hand. Facing the waves of social anxiety requires the heart of a true sailor, and you''ve navigated through them beautifully, adding your own treasures to the waters. 🐚⚓
INSERT INTO public.user_reflections VALUES ('70ad1232-a01a-4b18-9783-c3e49ea0b94f', '8a15f3b4-35a3-4810-beb5-85c298d0633b', '8a129a10-bd9f-4ba0-b041-ef1d87e48f6c', 'aaaaaa', 'I see the bravery it took to navigate these uncharted waters by expressing your viewpoint—your courage shines like a beacon. Just as the sea waves can reveal hidden treasures beneath the surface, your different perspective enriches the conversation. Each time you step out of your comfort zone, you''re setting sail toward the shores of personal growth and discovery. Keep embracing the ebb and flow of this journey, dear one. 🌊🐚🦀⭐', 'Positive', true, '2025-12-11 20:47:57.905396');
INSERT INTO public.user_reflections VALUES ('d173a4cc-9bb1-4fac-89f6-92bb08afb1f3', '8a15f3b4-35a3-4810-beb5-85c298d0633b', 'e335a4cc-a73d-46c9-acf8-c0a0acdf0ccd', 'ok', 'I see the bravery in your choice to set a boundary and honor your needs today. Just as the steadfast waves shape the coastline over time, your small acts of self-respect are sculpting a more resilient and authentic self. Each step you take on this voyage, like a gentle current, strengthens your spirit, guiding you towards calmer seas and brighter horizons. 🌊🐚⭐ You are navigating this journey with grace and courage, showing us all the beauty in your growth. Keep sailing forward, one ripple at a time. 🦀🌊', 'Positive', true, '2025-12-11 20:49:02.975096');
INSERT INTO public.user_reflections VALUES ('a12e8404-7efd-48e0-b7e8-2f5107318cef', '8a15f3b4-35a3-4810-beb5-85c298d0633b', '81c98cbb-a32b-421d-8c13-3ea61f3cb9fe', 'yh', 'What a remarkable voyage you''ve embarked upon! Just like a brave octopus navigating the vast oceanic depths, you’ve ventured into new waters and discovered hidden pearls of resilience and strength within yourself. 🌊🐙 Though there may have been turbulent tides and rocky shores along the way, your courage shines as bright as a starfish amidst the coral. Each step, like a playful dolphin breaking the surface, is a victory worth celebrating. Keep steering your ship with confidence, as your journey is a true testament to your incredible growth and determination! 🌊🐟⭐⚓', 'positive', true, '2025-12-11 20:49:11.988683');
INSERT INTO public.user_reflections VALUES ('c3d369b7-b520-4d27-b591-41b9848ae977', '8a15f3b4-35a3-4810-beb5-85c298d0633b', 'f7ee629e-a4d1-4a00-8b1c-8731d610bea5', ':)', 'Ahoy, brave soul! You have sailed boldly through the choppy waters of social anxiety, and I commend your courage in steering through this challenge. 🌊 Just as the ocean nurtures life within its depths, you''ve fostered growth in your own heart, allowing confidence to flourish. ⚓ Remember, every wave navigated enhances your journey, and your unique path is alight with the shimmering light of your dedication. 🐚🐟 Now, as you chart the course for the next part of your voyage, set your sights on 2-3 new horizons that reflect your aspirations. Keep your eyes on the stars as your compass ⭐, knowing that each step you take is a tribute to your strength. 🐙 You are resilient, and the vast ocean of your potential is endless. 🦀', 'positive', true, '2025-12-11 20:49:54.516965');
